<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: A complete mystery whose earliest recorded appearance has been tied to the development of archotechnology and the first occurrences of Transcendence, the archons are an enigmatic race of quasi-humans capable of moving between dimensions. They have an optimized physiology for psycasting and are renowned for extreme levels of aggression even amongst themselves.\n\nDue to lack of communication between humans and archons, very little concrete information has been gleaned from what few interactions have been documented amongst the stars. However, there are numerous instances of archons kidnapping humans throughout the entirety of known space and any attempts at killing them are thwarted by the dimensional rifts from which they appear. No current technology exists that can observe, much less cross, different dimensions, and yet these archons appear without warning, following no pattern, and always exploiting any vulnerabilities. Their equipment appears to be of archotech origin, aligning with reports of planets with a significant human presence undergoing Transcendence, exhibiting a correspondingly elevated presence of archons.-->
  <VRE_Archon.description>执政官是一个神秘的准人类种族，能够在维度之间移动，其最早的出现记录与考古技术的发展和超越的首次出现有关，这是一个完整的谜团。他们拥有优化的心理施法生理学，甚至在他们之间也以极端的攻击性而闻名。

由于人类和执政官之间缺乏沟通，从恒星之间记录的很少的相互作用中收集到的具体信息非常少。然而，在整个已知空间中，有许多执政官绑架人类的例子，任何杀死他们的尝试都会因他们出现的维度裂缝而受挫。目前还没有任何技术可以观察、更不用说交叉不同的维度，但这些执政官却毫无预警地出现，不遵循任何模式，并且总是利用任何漏洞。他们的设备似乎源自考古技术，与有大量人类存在的行星正在经历超越的报告一致，显示出执政官的存在相应增加。</VRE_Archon.description>
  <!--EN: A complete mystery whose earliest recorded appearance has been tied to the development of archotechnology and the first occurrences of Transcendence, the archons are an enigmatic race of quasi-humans capable of moving between dimensions. They have an optimized physiology for psycasting and are renowned for extreme levels of aggression even amongst themselves.-->
  <VRE_Archon.descriptionShort>执政官是一个神秘的准人类种族，能够在维度之间移动，其最早的出现记录与考古技术的发展和超越的首次出现有关，这是一个完整的谜团。他们具有优化的心理施法生理机能，并且以极端的攻击性而闻名，甚至在他们之间也是如此。</VRE_Archon.descriptionShort>
  <!--EN: archon-->
  <VRE_Archon.label>执政官</VRE_Archon.label>
</LanguageData>
